      "slide_role": "masterclass",
      "background_kind": "profield",
      "heading": "1 · Colour is a relation",
      "sentence": "Teach palettes through interaction, contrast, and context — not isolated RGB sliders.",
      "prompt": "Albers 2013 — page cite still open",
      "quote": "Colour answers to its neighbours before it answers to a number.",
