    {
      "slide_role": "masterclass",
      "background_kind": "profield",
      "heading": "3 · Platform tones are historical",
      "sentence": "Creator tools circulate lighting, colour trends, and tones that look “professional” for a season — treat them as signals to compare, not defaults to copy.",
      "quote": "Sharing expertise and using specific technologies result in visuality that reflect certain editing styles that are popular at a given moment.",
